{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 创作意图论文｜大白话教学总图\n\n目标：\n**先把社会已有方法学懂，再谈十元与论文。**\n\n不背英文。\n能从真实创作问题里认出来才算学会。"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1900,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# ① WHY｜创作主权\nAI 越能无限生产\n→ 我怎样仍然保持“这是我的创作”"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1250,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# ② JUDGE｜审美决定\n技术/约束/意图都对\n→ 为什么我仍然可以 REJECT"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -600,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# ③ REPRESENT｜当前深挖\n怎样把“我为什么这样创作”\n整理成 AI 能持续理解的结构"
    },
    {
      "id": "social",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# 社会已经做到哪\n\nPrompt\n↓\n属性 Attribute\n↓\n标签 Tag\n↓\n节点 Node\n↓\n关系 Edge / Relation\n↓\n理由 Rationale\n↓\n动态 Intent / Transition\n↓\n跨阶段保持\n\n所以：\n**“结构化创作意图”本身不是新点。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ten",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 十元现在放哪里\n\n普通 Intent Graph 负责：\nGoal / Choice / Constraint / Property / Stage / Evidence\n\n十元只作为候选关系层：\n- 十元语义\n- 生 / 克 / 补\n- 主 / 次\n- T / M / E / C\n- 动态链 Relation Transition\n\n不是整个方法本体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 最后怎么验证\n\nB3｜Generic Dynamic Intent Graph\n普通强关系图\n\nVS\n\nB4｜Ten-Yuan Dynamic Relation Layer\n十元关系层\n\n↓\n先预测、后揭盲\n↓\n真实：ACCEPT / REWORK / REJECT\n\n**B4≈B3 → 十元无额外增量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "teachroot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# 名词教学流程｜275 专项\n\n懂 → 物 → 己 → 社会 → 十元 → 论文相关性 → 忆 → 用\n\n每个名词最后分：\nP0 核心 / P1 实验 / P2 背景 / P3 放掉"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1600,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# 1｜懂 + 物\n\n先一句大白话\n再变成看得见的东西\n\nNode = 一张意思卡\nEdge = 两张卡之间的线\nConstraint = 一个不能动的红锁"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -980,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# 2｜己\n\n必须进你的真实项目：\n黎黎隆 / 方志敏\n角色 / 场景 / H3\nPASS / REWORK / REJECT\n\n不能举自己的例子 = 还没学会"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -360,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# 3｜社会\n\n问：\n**别人遇到了什么问题，才需要这个概念？**\n\n不是只查英文定义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 4｜十元\n\n理解社会概念后再比：\nT0 不同\nT1 同类\nT2 十元细化\nT3 可能新增\nT4 社会更成熟\n\n禁止硬映射。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# 5｜论文相关性\n\nP0｜论文核心\nP1｜实验必须\nP2｜背景理解\nP3｜当前放掉\n\n防止每学一个词就把论文扩大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 6｜忆 + 用\n\n关闭答案主动回忆\n↓\n给陌生案例重新识别\n↓\nKNOWN → RECOGNIZE → APPLY → TRANSFER\n\n能迁移才算学会。"
    },
    {
      "id": "course",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 600,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# 7课顺序\n\n1 Node / Edge / Relation Type\n2 Constraint / Priority\n3 State / Transition / Dynamic Intent\n4 Relation Transition\n5 Baseline / Blind Test / Holdout\n6 十元映射：生克补 / 主次 / T/M/E/C\n7 拼成你的5000字论文\n\n**下一步从第1课开始。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 600,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# 第一批必须会的词\n\nP0：\nNode / Edge / Relation Type\nConstraint / Priority / Rationale\nState / Transition / Dynamic Intent\nBaseline / Blind Test\n\nP1：\nDirection / Weight / Holdout\n\nP2：\nMacro-F1 等统计细节\n\n暂时不学整套图论/因果图数学。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/创作意图论文_社会名词大白话教学路线.md",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
